Chromium 156.0.8078.12 -> 156.0.8078.35, for the 156.0.8078.12 release tarball.

Generated from the upstream diffs between the tags (chromium/src
refs/tags/156.0.8078.12..156.0.8078.35, 625 commits) and the dependencies
whose DEPS revision changed (v8, third_party/angle, third_party/pdfium,
third_party/devtools-frontend/src, third_party/crabbyavif/src,
third_party/icu), as served by Gitiles.

Left out, as they cannot affect a Linux build: files not in the release
tarball (ios/, most Android and test data), iOS/Android/ChromeOS/Mac/Windows
-only files, tests and docs, translations other than en-GB, PGO/AFDO/orderfile
pointers for other platforms, submodule pointer updates. Everything else is
kept, including files no build target declares as an input.

Added: third_party/icu/common/icudtl.dat as a git binary patch (new time zone
data), and the tarball's generated files for the new commit
(build/util/LASTCHANGE{,.committime}, gpu/config/gpu_lists_version.h, commit
4befba4e8237fc6452fe5918001a01235180e6fc, refs/branch-heads/8078@{#1195}).

Checked: applies to the 156.0.8078.12 tarball; chrome/VERSION becomes
156.0.8078.35; a random sample of 40 patched files plus icudtl.dat is
byte-identical to the 156.0.8078.35 versions.

Apply with git apply (contains a binary patch).

